title: Переговоры
tags: negotiations

@negotiate_zhirinovsky
title: Владимир Жириновский (ЛДПР)
view-if: negotiation_timer <= 0
on-arrival: negotiation_timer = 3

- @zhirinovsky_pact: Пакт о честных выборах.

@zhirinovsky_pact
on-arrival: zhirinovsky_relation += 10
go-to: main

@negotiate_lebed
title: Александр Лебедь
view-if: negotiation_timer <= 0
on-arrival: negotiation_timer = 5

- @lebed_order: Союз на почве порядка.

@lebed_order
on-arrival: lebed_relation += 5
go-to: main
